Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.67,1:32:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.62,1:32:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.92,1:32:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝这个
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.48,1:32:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直要了我的命
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.54,1:32:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.48,1:32:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这味道像猫
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.08,1:32:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,更多的？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.52,1:32:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,请多做一点
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.98,1:33:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.80,1:33:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,多多触动我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.64,1:33:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我碰你哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.63,1:33:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,随意触摸我的阴部
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.98,1:33:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.11,1:33:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,猫滴水/我讨厌它
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.75,1:33:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,触摸自己
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.49,1:33:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,直接/触摸？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.00,1:33:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.24,1:33:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我这里洒了很多水
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.57,1:33:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.10,1:33:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.60,1:33:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,伸出你的舌头
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.74,1:34:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你有过这样的感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.34,1:34:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以让它更激烈一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.24,1:34:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是/那么
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.49,1:34:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没有停止
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.71,1:34:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.75,1:34:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.96,1:34:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.10,1:35:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,阴部被吸
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.46,1:35:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.06,1:35:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,离开
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.68,1:35:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.40,1:35:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样躺着
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.74,1:35:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就吻我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.61,1:35:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这里做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.79,1:35:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,请流口水
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.57,1:35:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请流口水
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.58,1:35:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.94,1:36:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.75,1:36:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.47,1:36:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,又流口水了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.37,1:36:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不，走开
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.97,1:36:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.64,1:36:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.42,1:36:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,伸出你的舌头
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.02,1:36:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,张开嘴并伸出舌头
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.25,1:36:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你一些好东西
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.32,1:37:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道它是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.45,1:37:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你想吸它吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.29,1:37:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直要了我的命
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.80,1:37:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.39,1:37:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你也想在这里做吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.40,1:37:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.47,1:37:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我想舔它
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.79,1:37:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.71,1:37:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,请让我吸很多。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.32,1:37:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,握住我的鸡鸡/我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.57,1:38:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是的/让我休息一下
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.27,1:38:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在公鸡上
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.27,1:38:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,请流口水
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.30,1:38:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也让它流向那里
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.11,1:38:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,两者同时
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.78,1:38:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.32,1:38:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,轮流吸吮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.25,1:38:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.50,1:38:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.12,1:38:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.25,1:39:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想看看这些公鸡是什么样子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.90,1:39:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要见你
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.81,1:39:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这么大了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.66,1:40:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你的鸡巴太烂了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.04,1:40:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,惊人的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.22,1:40:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直要了我的命
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.39,1:40:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样张开双腿
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.72,1:40:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我会从这里吸它。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.18,1:41:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看这里
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.67,1:41:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.69,1:41:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,更多这个
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.59,1:41:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就这样互相吸吮
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.86,1:41:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，很好
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.06,1:42:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.94,1:42:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.36,1:42:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,吸吮公鸡
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.77,1:42:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,打飞机时
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.03,1:42:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,多吸我的鸡巴
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.26,1:42:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,吃得深
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.18,1:42:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我直接用嘴吸可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.39,1:43:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的我
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.88,1:43:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？ / 把它放进去
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.77,1:43:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.50,1:43:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你操我
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.31,1:43:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样？ / 呵呵
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.28,1:43:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？ / 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.60,1:43:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.20,1:43:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.75,1:43:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来了啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.52,1:43:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢它，因为我操过它。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.52,1:43:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.58,1:43:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,当我放下它时我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.16,1:43:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧死了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.90,1:44:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别说话了，吸它吧。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.89,1:44:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,离开
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.68,1:44:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,更深
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.28,1:44:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.76,1:44:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.12,1:44:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不/请为我射精
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.20,1:44:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.97,1:44:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.23,1:44:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.42,1:45:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.65,1:45:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,来到一垒
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.84,1:45:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了/我非常喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.07,1:45:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我感觉很好。\N- 它自己移动。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.57,1:45:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.55,1:45:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.89,1:45:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.36,1:46:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不，走开
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.98,1:46:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.81,1:46:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,湿了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.73,1:46:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.99,1:46:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,甘达特
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.60,1:47:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我要去，我要去
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.85,1:47:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.51,1:47:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.21,1:48:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.16,1:48:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,吸这里
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.77,1:48:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.78,1:48:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,双腿张开得更宽
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.23,1:48:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.49,1:48:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.38,1:48:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.68,1:48:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.41,1:48:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我射了很多次
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.87,1:48:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.27,1:48:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,停止
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.30,1:49:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法，只能走开
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.97,1:49:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,回转
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.27,1:49:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以上它
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.82,1:49:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都湿了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.87,1:49:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.93,1:49:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.22,1:49:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.76,1:49:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.21,1:49:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没有。/你感觉好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.79,1:49:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我太喜欢它了，我做不到。离开。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.43,1:50:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我浑身湿透了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.24,1:50:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,触摸这里/我不能，我要疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.46,1:50:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不能
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.98,1:50:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,它消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.45,1:50:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我去我去
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.20,1:50:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,拥抱
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.23,1:51:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到，我要疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.64,1:51:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.45,1:51:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,离开
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.68,1:51:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直要了我的命
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.99,1:51:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.08,1:51:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.46,1:51:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我要去。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.39,1:52:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我要死了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.25,1:52:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.11,1:52:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说他们抽搐得很厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.42,1:52:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.59,1:53:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,甘达特
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.97,1:53:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,离开
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.37,1:53:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.72,1:53:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,停止
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.77,1:53:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.04,1:54:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.86,1:54:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不，走开。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.88,1:55:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.28,1:55:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧死了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.58,1:55:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.64,1:55:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.28,1:55:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不，不。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.57,1:55:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.99,1:55:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.78,1:56:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.72,1:56:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.88,1:56:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.02,1:56:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不可能了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.21,1:56:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,打开就OK了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.63,1:57:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.20,1:57:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,事情变得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.34,1:57:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.74,1:57:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去。
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.70,1:57:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这真的很酷/我不能
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.11,1:57:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.48,1:57:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以射精吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.72,1:57:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.94,1:57:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不，走开
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.69,1:58:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.95,1:58:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.18,1:58:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.63,1:58:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再次走开
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.85,1:58:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,会很便宜
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.99,1:58:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.38,1:58:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,便宜的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.70,1:59:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.44,1:59:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.68,1:59:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.98,1:59:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.03,1:59:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我要死了
